.SH EXAMPLES
One vulnerable\->fixed pair per ecosystem (Python).
.SS Python
\fIVulnerable:\fR
.RS
.EX
db.save(user_id, password)          # password stored in cleartext
.EE
.RE
\fIFixed:\fR
.RS
.EX
import bcrypt
db.save(user_id, bcrypt.hashpw(password.encode(), bcrypt.gensalt()))
.EE
.RE
